Nocturne Memory Core

This public edition contains the reusable continuity, memory, retrieval,
analysis, and Dashboard mechanisms. Private identity material, relationship
history, memory data, artwork, credentials, device integrations, animated
opening, Atmosphere, Gravity, and household room topology are not distributed.

## Provenance

Nocturne Memory Core is a secondary development of the memory-core lineage of
Ombre Brain by @P0luz:

  https://github.com/P0luz/Ombre-Brain

It retains the Markdown / YAML memory substrate, hold / breath retrieval loop,
Dashboard-oriented operation, and natural archival / decay machinery, and adds
continuity layers such as selective Breath composition, Drive / DP traces,
Thought Pool, latent fragments, Marginalia / Shape Trace, Trails, and
related write-back paths.

Ombre Brain continues as its own project. Feature sets diverge; this package
is not a drop-in of any particular Ombre Brain release.

